{# goal: Compute convergence metric for create-skill PDCA cycles. #}
{#
  Group: B (Analysis/Diagnosis)
  Convergence method: validation pass/fail count
  Measures: Fraction of critical and high-severity checks that passed.
  Threshold: 0.25 — skill creation should converge quickly.
  When not converged, emits next_describe_focus to direct the next
  iteration's describe phase (e.g., "fix Z5: add visibility: public to
